{"timestamp": 1783633047.408361, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1783633059.510182, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I reported Charlie\u2019s body in weapons. My route this round was medbay -> electrical -> security -> weapons. I didn\u2019t encounter anyone at all on the way. When I passed through electrical earlier I didn\u2019t see anyone there, then I went through security and found Charlie dead in weapons. I don\u2019t have a suspect yet, but there are two deaths, so we need routes from everyone."}}
{"timestamp": 1783633071.5238771, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Bob here. My route was weapons -> security -> navigation. Weapons was clear when I started there. I saw Charlie alive in security around ticks 2 to 4, and I didn\u2019t see anyone else at all after that. Then I went to navigation and didn\u2019t see the body.\n\nSo Charlie must have left security and gone toward weapons after I saw him, or the kill happened after that window. I can\u2019t place Diana at all. Alice\u2019s report location lines up with Charlie being alive earlier in security, but we need Eve and Frank\u2019s routes because I only saw Charlie this round."}}
{"timestamp": 1783633089.414248, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I started cafeteria, went into weapons for a task, and I did see Charlie come in from security around then. I left him alive there pretty quickly and went back through cafeteria toward electrical. Later I saw Diana alive in electrical while I was there doing wires, but I didn\u2019t see Alice, Bob, or Eve at all.\n\nBob\u2019s info matches what I saw: Charlie was in security, then moved into weapons. Alice finding him there makes sense. The worrying thing is I have zero info on Eve this round, and with two bodies we really need her route, especially where she was around weapons/electrical."}}
{"timestamp": 1783633112.236305, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I was not near weapons or electrical for most of this. My route was storage into lower engine, and I didn\u2019t directly meet anyone. The only movement I saw was Diana around storage at about T4 \u2014 it looked like she came in from navigation and moved out toward medbay basically right away. I never saw Charlie.\n\nLooking at the routes: Bob\u2019s and Frank\u2019s stories line up that Charlie went security into weapons. Alice found Charlie in weapons. The big issue to me is Frank is the only person who admits seeing Charlie alive in weapons and then also says he later saw Diana alive in electrical. That puts Frank as the last known contact with both dead players, unless Alice self-reported.\n\nI know Frank is pointing at me because he didn\u2019t see me, but I was in storage/lower engine, not near the reported body. Based on actual opportunity, I think Frank is the strongest suspect here."}}
{"timestamp": 1783633128.5428, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019ll restate mine clearly: I went medbay -> electrical -> security -> weapons, saw nobody the entire route, and found Charlie\u2019s body in weapons.\n\nGiven what everyone said, Bob and Frank both place Charlie moving security into weapons. Frank is the only one saying he was actually in weapons with Charlie and left him alive, then he also says he later saw Diana alive in electrical. That makes Frank the last known contact for both bodies, which is definitely the strongest pattern right now.\n\nEve being unseen is not great, but her route is away from Charlie\u2019s body. I\u2019m more suspicious of Frank than Eve based on opportunity."}}
{"timestamp": 1783633145.533516, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "My info is the same: I was weapons -> security -> navigation. Weapons was clear when I started, and Charlie was alive with me in security from about tick 2 to tick 4. I never saw Diana.\n\nThe important part is Frank\u2019s story puts him with Charlie in weapons after Charlie left security, and then also puts him with Diana in electrical later. That makes Frank the last known person around both dead players.\n\nEve being unseen is a concern, but her Diana timing doesn\u2019t directly contradict me \u2014 if Diana moved through navigation/storage around tick 4, I may have just missed her while I was still in security or moving after. Alice could technically self-report, but we don\u2019t have anything placing her with Diana, and her report location fits Charlie moving into weapons.\n\nSo based on opportunity and last contact with both bodies, I\u2019m leaning Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1783633164.245397, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I get why \u201clast contact\u201d sounds bad, but you\u2019re turning \u201cI gave info\u201d into \u201cI did both kills.\u201d I volunteered both sightings because they\u2019re real.\n\nCharlie: Bob saw him in security, then I saw Charlie enter weapons from security. I was only there briefly, left him alive, and went back cafeteria side. Alice is the one who comes later through security into weapons and reports him. I\u2019m not saying Alice definitely self-reported, but there is a window after I left.\n\nDiana: Eve is the one who says she saw Diana around storage earlier, and nobody can confirm Eve\u2019s route at all. I saw Diana alive in electrical later while I was doing wires. If Alice says she went medbay -> electrical -> security -> weapons and saw nobody, the timing matters a lot \u2014 because if she passed electrical after I saw Diana there, then something doesn\u2019t line up.\n\nEve has been completely unaccounted for, gives a route nobody saw, and is pushing me mainly because I was honest about sightings. I think we need exact timings from Alice on electrical, because right now Eve is using my info to frame me while giving nothing verifiable."}}
{"timestamp": 1783633181.341008, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I\u2019ll clarify my route again because Frank is trying to make \u201cunseen\u201d sound like \u201cguilty.\u201d I was storage -> lower engine. I didn\u2019t meet anyone directly, but I saw Diana\u2019s movement at T4: she came into storage from navigation and immediately left storage toward medbay. I did not see Charlie at all, and I was nowhere near weapons or electrical.\n\nFrank\u2019s Diana sighting can fit after mine if she moved from storage toward medbay and later ended up electrical. That doesn\u2019t clear Frank \u2014 it means he\u2019s still the last person claiming to see Diana alive.\n\nFor Charlie, Bob saw Charlie alive in security, then Frank says Charlie came into weapons and Frank was there with him, then Alice later finds Charlie dead in weapons. So Frank is also the last known person with Charlie alive in the actual room where the body was found.\n\nAlice and Bob\u2019s routes line up with each other. Mine is unverified, yes, but it doesn\u2019t put me near Charlie\u2019s body. Frank\u2019s route puts him with both dead players shortly before they died. I think the strongest evidence is on Frank, and I\u2019m voting Frank."}}
